<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Skate! Newsletter</title>
  
  <link href="https://jsdelivr.net" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://jsdelivr.net" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://googleapis.com/css2?family=Special+Elite&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    h1, h2, h3, .navbar-brand, .btn {
      font-family: 'Special Elite', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }

    .grid-img {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 500px;
      height: auto;
    }

    .custom-icon {
      font-size: 3em;
    }

    .row {
      padding-bottom: 50px;
    }

    @media only screen and (max-width: 500px) {
      h2 {
        padding-top: 50px;
      }
      .btn {
        background-color: teal !important;
        border-color: teal !important;
        color: white !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

  <nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg bg-dark" data-bs-theme="dark">
    <div class="container-fluid">
      <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Skate! Newsletter</a>
      <button class="navbar-brand navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav" aria-controls="navbarNav" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation">
        <span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span>
      </button>
      <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav">
        <ul class="navbar-nav">
          <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link active" href="#">Current issue</a>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">Past issues</a>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item">
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">Follow us</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <div class="container col-xxl-8 px-4 py-5"> 
    <div class="row flex-lg-row-reverse align-items-center g-5 py-5"> 
      <div class="col-10 col-sm-8 col-lg-6"> 
        <img src="https://unsplash.com" class="d-block mx-lg-auto img-fluid" alt="Skateboard collection layout" width="700" height="500" loading="lazy"> 
      </div> 
      <div class="col-lg-6"> 
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold text-body-emphasis lh-1 mb-3">Skate! Newsletter</h1> 
        <p class="lead">Get your monthly breakdown of local shred spots, exclusive gear reviews, interviews with resident pros, and archival media features delivered right to your inbox.</p> 
        <div class="d-grid gap-2 d-md-flex justify-content-md-start"> 
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-dark btn-lg px-4 me-md-2">Subscribe Now</button> 
        </div> 
      </div> 
    </div> 
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="row text-center align-items-center">
      <div class="col-md-6 mb-4 mb-md-0 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <h2>Local Spotlights</h2>
        <p>Exploring the newest DIY transition concrete park builds happening downtown this summer.</p>
        <img src="https://unsplash.com" class="grid-img mb-3" alt="Skateboard feature">
        <button class="btn btn-dark">Read Article</button>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <h2>Gear Breakdown</h2>
        <p>Testing out hard versus soft wheels on rough street terrain to see what matches your style.</p>
        <img src="https://unsplash.com" class="grid-img mb-3" alt="Skateboard feature 2">
        <button class="btn btn-dark">View Reviews</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row text-center">
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <div class="custom-icon text-dark mb-2"><i class="bi bi-mailbox"></i></div>
        <h3>Weekly Digests</h3>
        <p>Straight to the point summaries sent out every Friday morning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 mb-4 mb-md-0 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <div class="custom-icon text-dark mb-2"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></div>
        <h3>Community Led</h3>
        <p>Articles written entirely by skate enthusiasts and local builders.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4 d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
        <div class="custom-icon text-dark mb-2"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div>
        <h3>Zero Spam</h3>
        <p>No advertisements or tracking scripts. Unsubscribe anytime.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <footer class="footer mt-auto py-3 bg-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="text-muted">This is a bootstrap exercise</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://jsdelivr.net"></script>
</body>
</html>